## Timeline Status

Project is on track for September 15, 2026 go-live.

Phase 1 (Requirements) completed July 22 - two weeks early.
Phase 2 (Design) is 40% complete, on track for August 22 completion.
Phase 3 (Development) scheduled to start August 25.
Phase 4 (UAT) scheduled for September 8-15.
Go-Live: September 15, 2026.

