## Risks & Issues

### Risk 1: Resource Availability (MEDIUM)
Description: Primary developer is scheduled to be 50% available for 3 weeks starting Sept 1
Impact: Could impact development timeline
Mitigation: External contractor identified and ready as backup

### Risk 2: Integration Complexity (MEDIUM)
Description: System integration points increased from 8 to 12
Impact: Development timeline could extend
Mitigation: Prioritized integration roadmap; prototyping key integrations

### Risk 3: Data Quality Issues (LOW)
Description: 20% of client records have incomplete information
Impact: Data migration could have quality issues
Mitigation: Data validation logic in migration; manual review for flagged records

Key Issues:
- Data migration dry run required for August 28
- Rollback plan needed

